## Design System

### Colors

| Token | Hex | Usage |
|-------|-----|-------|
| Cream canvas | `#ECECE8` | Page background, hero, outro |
| Forest green | `#2B4937` | Main content strip background |
| Deep green | `#244231` | Seeds panel background |
| Dark green | `#0E3522` | Index switcher circle |
| Accent green | `#4FAF6F` | Progress bars, highlights |
| Text light | `#F7F5F0` | Light text on dark backgrounds |
| Text dark | `#0D2E1D` | Dark text on light panels |
| Rose muted | `#9B7B80` | Declining stock indicators |

### Typography

| Class | Font | Usage |
|-------|------|-------|
| `font-display` | OPTI Century Expanded Two | "GARDEN" titles, stock tickers, section headers, goal labels |
| `font-sans` (default) | Instrument Sans | UI text, labels, navigation |
| `font-body` | Cutive | Date/time display, body prose, footer |

### Key Design Principles

- **Lowercase everything** — headings, labels, and UI text are lowercase
- **Generous whitespace** — sections breathe with large padding and gaps
- **Nature photography** — 5 images in `public/garden/` provide visual texture
- **Quiet interactions** — subtle hover states, smooth scroll, no flashy animations
- **Warm palette** — cream and forest green dominate; no harsh whites or blacks
- **Mobile-first** — all layouts start mobile, then add `sm:` / `md:` / `lg:` variants

---

## Page Sections (in order)

### 1. Hero
- Date/time header (font-body, 11px)
- "good [morning/afternoon/evening] {displayName}, welcome to your" greeting
- Giant "GARDEN" title (font-display, clamp 3.5rem–12rem)
- "nourishment awaits" button → smooth scrolls to stream section

### 2. Stream (from Substack)
- Live RSS articles from user's configured Substack feeds
- 2-column grid (1-col on mobile) showing title, author, reading time
- Clickable links open in new tab
- Data source: `POST /api/feeds` with user's substackFeeds

### 3. Index Switcher
- Circular dark green navigation element (140px mobile, 190px desktop)
- 4 labels: stream, seeds, winds, growth
- Clicking scrolls to that section + highlights active
- Intersection observer auto-updates as user scrolls

### 4. Seeds (from Robinhood / Yahoo Finance)
- Live stock quotes using user's configured tickers
- Shows ticker, company name, % change, direction arrow
- Green (↗) for up, rose (↘) for down
- Checkbox circles for marking as "read" (persisted to localStorage)
- Data source: `GET /api/stocks?tickers={user_tickers}`

### 5. Winds (News)
- Live news headlines from user's configured news feeds
- 3-column layout on desktop, single column on mobile
- Clickable links to full articles
- Data source: `POST /api/feeds` with user's newsFeeds

### 6. Growth (Financial Goals)
- Dynamic goal tracker reading from `preferences.growthGoals`
- Progress bars with percentage circles
- Goals are editable from the preferences page
- Future: connect to actual bank API via Plaid

### 7. Outro
- Lao Tzu quote: "Knowing others is intelligence; knowing yourself is true wisdom."
- Closing "GARDEN" title
- Footer with links (preferences → `/preferences`, about us, contact)

